  "body": "This north-facing coastal retreat delivers panoramic sea views, all-day sun and an enviable connection to the water. With dolphins and whales frequently spotted over your morning coffee and a walkway down to the water's edge just across the road, you can't beat this for coastal living. At low tide, wander around the reef to Red Beach for a bite at the Surf Club; at high tide, dive straight into your favourite water sport. With four double bedrooms, expansive entertaining spaces and a private spa pool, there's plenty to make you want to stay.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Panoramic ocean views stretching right across to Great Barrier Island \r\n* North-facing orientation capturing all-day sun\r\n* Open-plan living flowing seamlessly to substantial outdoor decks\r\n* Private rear deck with an undercover outdoor lounge space and a spa pool\r\n* Generous master suite with a large walk-in wardrobe, breathtaking views and space for a work-from-home setup or parents retreat\r\n* Two bathrooms and a separate laundry\r\n* Fireplace and heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n* Off-street parking complete with EV charger\r\n* Garden-to-table living with established vegetable gardens\r\n* Outdoor shower for rinsing off after sandy beach days \r\n* Huge basement storage area \r\n* Quiet cul-de-sac position in one of the Hibiscus Coast's most sought-after streets\r\n\r\nWith the ocean, local amenities and motorway access all close at hand, and dual school zoning for both Red Beach and Stanmore Bay schools - this location works beautifully for families, while equally appealing to retirees and executives seeking a relaxed coastal lifestyle. Coastal walkways, local cafes and everything the wider Hibiscus Coast has to offer are within easy reach. It's a home where weekends feel like a holiday and everyday life is elevated by the proximity to the sea.\r\n\r\nOcean views like these. A position like this. A lifestyle you'll want to make your own. Don't miss your chance to secure it.\r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday 10th December at 3:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/PV47 \r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
